# The receptionist's first-run tour (W5, S24): `world.tour` (here `inject cats {"tour": true}`) takes
# you to the reception and opens her first balloon — the keys to walk between desks (h l J K) —
# with "Próximo" / "Pular". Under --demo the WM never starts it by itself. User-approval shot.
key J
wait 600
inject cats {"tour":true}
wait 1500
expect mode CONVERSA
expect json /ext/cats/tour 0
expect json /ext/cats/dialog/row "Tour"
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-tour.png
key 1
wait 1500
expect json /ext/cats/tour 1
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-tour-2.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-cats-tour.json
quit
